# Storyboard source. One line per composition:
#   beats | on screen | what this moment is for | how it leaves | carried into next shot
# "## N Title | target_beats" starts a chapter. 1 beat = 0.75 s. Types: FULL = full-frame type,
# CLOSE = camera close on a detail, WIDE = whole diagram, OVER = overhead / map view, 3D = three.js.

## 0 Cold open | 80
